      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "On a Merit Obelisk island, Fang Yuan as Chu Ying is a transformation path Gu Immortal and obtains a lot of transformation path immortal materials when the group scavenges and redistributes resources. Because transformation path projects all paths, those materials can be of various types and paths.",
